   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "77_167778512186880985",
   "text": "Robert Jenrick: we don\u2019t want people to come across in small boats",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "79_167778512186880985",
   "text": "Anon: Robert Jenrick: we don\u2019t want people to come across in small boats",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "81_167778512186880985",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "84_167778512186880985",
   "text": "Robert Jenrick made it very clear that they don\u2019t want to let more people come to the UK in small boats ",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "85_167778512186880985",
   "text": "Robert Jenrick: I\u2019ve made that very clear",
